It bundles:
- htmx 2.0.11 (src/fonti/web/static/htmx.min.js), Zero-Clause BSD license,
  https://github.com/bigskysoftware/htmx

It downloads at run time, from their publishers, models that are not part of this
repository and keep their own licenses:
- ibm-granite/granite-embedding-311m-multilingual-r2 (Apache-2.0) - embeddings
  (BAAI/bge-m3, MIT, is a tested alternative)
- BAAI/bge-reranker-v2-m3 (Apache-2.0) - reranking
- Docling layout and table structure models (docling-project, see their model cards)
- EasyOCR detection and recognition models (Apache-2.0)
- the LLM chosen in Ollama, by default gemma4:12b (Apache-2.0)

The evaluation corpus (eval/corpus) is downloaded by `fonti eval corpus` and is not
redistributed. Its documents keep their own terms:
- Costituzione della Repubblica Italiana: official act, excluded from copyright
  (art. 5, Legge 633/1941); source: Presidenza della Repubblica
- Regulations (EU) 2016/679 and 2024/1689: (c) European Union, https://eur-lex.europa.eu,
  reuse authorised with acknowledgement of the source (Decision 2011/833/EU)
- AgID, Linee guida sul documento informatico: act of a public administration
- ISTAT, Occupati e disoccupati, luglio 2026: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
The synthetic documents in eval/corpus/synthetic are part of this project (CC0) and contain
only invented names and data.
